{
  "name": "before-prefix",
  "note": "::before generates its inline box before the element's other inline content (exercising the legacy single-colon :before form too): the span's x is pushed right by the generated prefix, the box width/height grow to fit, and the pseudo's computed style reports the string content. The prefix glyphs participate in the screenshot comparison.",
  "harvest": {
